+# Request
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price (dailyPrice × days). Quotes and bookings
+both show the reduced total.
+
+# Approach
+
+- In `src/index.ts`, `price()` applies the discount when `days >= 3`; `quote` and `book` share it.
+- Totals stay integer euro cents: the discounted total is `round(full × 90 / 100)`, half up.
+- Tests cover 2 days (no discount), 3 days (boundary), a longer rental, rounding, and booking parity.
